      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The New River, one of the oldest rivers in the eastern United States, winds through Jefferson, offering scenic Appalachian views.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jefferson%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Jefferson’s high elevation gives it a subtropical highland climate, with snowy winters and cooler summers than nearby lowlands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
